<title>USA: Maxim Group Q1 shr $0.20 vs $0.08.</title>
<headline>Maxim Group Q1 shr $0.20 vs $0.08.</headline>
<dateline>KENNESAW, Ga. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>4/30/97	 4/30/96</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>Retail Related Revenues:</p>
<p>  Sale of Floorcovering		$ 33,590,615  $ 27,129,116</p>
<p>  Franchise Related Revenues	    7,281,256     5,911,659</p>
<p>  Other					 1,454,948	 614,083</p>
<p>  Total Retail Revenues		  42,326,819    33,654,858</p>
