<p>Other</p>
<p>  Total Revenues:			  86,224,795    73,242,119</p>
<p>  Costs of Good Sold		     59,154,404    52,958,163</p>
<p>  Gross Profit			     27,070,391    20,283,956</p>
<p>  Gross Profit/Sales			   31.40%	  27.69%</p>
<p> SGA					   20,438,138    17,124,726</p>
