<p>   outstanding			     16,630,316    13,611,364</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Maxim Group Inc.</p>
<p>The company said Q1 earnings were affected by lower-than- expected costs within the company-owned retail network and stronger-than-expected sales within the franchise and Image divisions.</p>
